ve cell content] once VM `k` ran\n   `source` and its final state was collected with the suspended\n   generator named `root` as the only extra root: everything that\n   generator reaches, continuations followed, not one `:resume` alone.\n   The module's own globals are garbage once it completes, so without the\n   root nothing of the program would be live.\"\n  [k source root]\n  (let [ast (lower/lower-packet\n              (parser/parse-source (parser/make-worker) [:u 1] source))\n        final ((get final-vms k) ast (vm/ast->datoms ast))\n        roots (into []\n                    (keep (fn [[id {:keys [value seal]}]]\n                            (when (and (= :generator (:py/type value))\n                                       (= :suspended (:state value))\n                                       (= root (:name value)))\n                              {:type :cell-ref, :id id, :seal seal})))\n                    (:heap final))\n        heap (:heap (engine/collect final roots))]\n    (is (= 1 (count roots)) (str k \" one suspended \" root))\n    [(count heap) (reduce + (map (fn [[_ {:keys [value]}]] (deep-size value)) heap))]))\n\n\n(defn- changing-caller-source\n  \"`n` items through a `yield from` level, resumed alternately by a\n   function and by a fresh generator dropped after one step.\"\n  [n]\n  (lines \"def g():\"\n         \"    i = 0\"\n         \"    while True:\"\n         \"        yield i\"\n         \"        i += 1\"\n         \"def h():\"\n         \"    yield from g()\"\n         \"it = h()\"\n         \"def by_function(x):\"\n         \"    return next(x)\"\n         \"def by_generator(x):\"\n         \"    yield next(x)\"\n         \"k = 0\"\n         (str \"while k < \" n \":\")\n         \"    if k % 2 == 0:\"\n         \"        by_function(it)\"\n         \"    else:\"\n         \"        next(by_generator(it))\"\n         \"    k += 1\"))\n\n\n(deftest ^:slow reachable-heap-is-stable-under-delegation-test\n  (testing \"after a forced collection, the live heap (cells and their content,\n            continuations followed) is the same after 10 and after 1000 items\n            resumed through yield from by changing callers: no retention\n            grows per item or per caller\"\n    (doseq [k [:ast-walker :semantic :stack :register]]\n      (testing (str k)\n        (is (= (live-after-collection k (changing-caller-source 10) \"h\")\n               (live-after-collection k (changing-caller-source 1000) \"h\")))))))\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:432:     ;; no handler in the body catches reaches it and leaves the generator\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:435:           (py/set-handlers! (py/frame :generator (fn [e] (py/gen-fail g e)) nil))\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:438:     ;; the single way out of a finishing generator: closed, the caller's\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:451:                                                 {:py/str \"generator raised StopIteration\"})\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:470:     ;; the generator's own stack\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:498:         (py/type-error {:py/str \"can't send non-None value to a just-started generator\"})\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:501:     ;; `throw(typ, val)`: raised at the yield site on the generator's own\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:502:     ;; stack; a generator that never ran closes and the caller raises it\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:535:     ;; the generator stays suspended\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:542:                         {:py/str \"generator ignored GeneratorExit\"})\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:564:         (if (= t :generator)\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:572:     ;; `yield from x` (PEP 380): each message the outer generator receives\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:575:     ;; is raised here, on the outer generator's stack\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/prelude.cljc:587:     ;; cl