{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"I found a likely protocol bug in the delegation path: user-defined `send`/`throw` results are being treated as already-tagged generator outcomes, even though those special methods return ordinary guest values. I’m checking adjacent conversion paths and the exact heap-test strength before I finalize the severity and report."}}
